  "description": "Add a cozy holiday touch to your projects with this Gingerbread Christmas Digital Paper, featuring illustrated gingerbread men, cookies, hearts, trees, and mittens in warm brown, red, and green tones. This versatile seamless digital paper is perfect for scrapbooking, card making, junk journaling, and printable holiday crafts. Delivered as a high-resolution digital download for instant use, with commercial use included. \nWhat’s Included:\n• High-resolution JPG files\n• 12″ × 12″ (3600 × 3600 pixels)\n• 300 DPI for high-quality printing\n• Seamless repeating patterns\n• Ready for both print and digital use\nPerfect For:\n• Fabric & Textile Design\n• Sublimation Projects\n• Print-on-Demand Products\n• Scrapbooking & Card Making\n• Digital Planners & Journals\n• Wrapping Paper & Packaging\n• Stationery & Invitations\n• Home Décor & Wallpaper\n• Backgrounds for Websites & Social Media\n• DIY Crafts & Creative Projects\nThese seamless patterns are easy to use with most graphic design software and are ideal for creating beautiful, professional-quality products. Thank you for visiting my shop, and I hope this bundle inspires your next creative project!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a cozy holiday touch to your projects with this Gingerbread Christmas Digital Paper, featuring illustrated gingerbread men, cookies, hearts, trees, and mittens in warm brown, red, and green tones. This versatile seamless digital paper is perfect for scrapbooking, card making, junk journaling, and printable holiday crafts. Delivered as a high-resolution digital download for instant use, with commercial use included. </p>\n<p>What’s Included:</p>\n<p>• High-resolution JPG files<br>\n• 12″ × 12″ (3600 × 3600 pixels)<br>\n• 300 DPI for high-quality printing<br>\n• Seamless repeating patterns<br>\n• Ready for both print and digital use</p>\n<p>Perfect For:</p>\n<p>• Fabric &amp; Textile Design<br>\n• Sublimation Projects<br>\n• Print-on-Demand Products<br>\n• Scrapbooking &amp; Card Making<br>\n• Digital Planners &amp; Journals<br>\n• Wrapping Paper &amp; Packaging<br>\n• Stationery &amp; Invitations<br>\n• Home Décor &amp; Wallpaper<br>\n• Backgrounds for Websites &amp; Social Media<br>\n• DIY Crafts &amp; Creative Projects</p>\n<p>These seamless patterns are easy to use with most graphic design software and are ideal for creating beautiful, professional-quality products. Thank you for visiting my shop, and I hope this bundle inspires your next creative project!</p>",
